{"4026310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Printer Painter", "steam_appid": 4026310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Printer Painter is a solo third-person casual puzzle game with physics based elements. Unwind with easy to pick up level-based puzzles. Paint to your heart’s content in this cozy and fun adventure with unlimited hints and no time limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Pixel</strong>, a tiny robot working alongside other robots in making the Printer work. Dip yourself in printer ink and paint pages for printing. Upgrade your wheels and shred some secret documents. Reverse gravity and drive on the ceiling to scan images. Repair machines and help other robots. You are the only one who can fix the printer and save your home from being recycled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026310/extras/cb1e8a63d17a67e0bc62feae86e24d5f.poster.avif?t=1769180281\" aria-label=\"Pixel, the main character is standing under a color shower to coat himself in yellow paint. Full of yellow paint, Pixel drives and paints tiles around him to complete a puzzle. Pixel uses a large sponge cube to remove paint where the tiles are colored wrongly.\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026310/extras/cb1e8a63d17a67e0bc62feae86e24d5f.webm?t=1769180281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026310/extras/cb1e8a63d17a67e0bc62feae86e24d5f.mp4?t=1769180281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> Solve physics based color puzzles that rely on your wit and agility. Enjoy unlimited hints,  optional challenges and no time limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World:</strong> Explore different environments inside and outside the Printer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community:</strong> Meet and befriend other robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisation:</strong> Dress up your Pixel and decorate your Printer home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026310/extras/8c14e6dacc258357d69db4ea460b06d1.poster.avif?t=1769180281\" aria-label=\"Pixel is happy and waiving arms under a blue color shower. Then Pixel is shown driving really fast around the puzzle map.\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026310/extras/8c14e6dacc258357d69db4ea460b06d1.webm?t=1769180281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026310/extras/8c14e6dacc258357d69db4ea460b06d1.mp4?t=1769180281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Printer Painter is a solo third-person casual puzzle game with physics based elements. Unwind with easy to pick up level-based puzzles. Paint to your heart’s content in this cozy and fun adventure with unlimited hints and no time limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Pixel</strong>, a tiny robot working alongside other robots in making the Printer work. Dip yourself in printer ink and paint pages for printing. Upgrade your wheels and shred some secret documents. Reverse gravity and drive on the ceiling to scan images. Repair machines and help other robots. You are the only one who can fix the printer and save your home from being recycled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026310/extras/cb1e8a63d17a67e0bc62feae86e24d5f.poster.avif?t=1769180281\" aria-label=\"Pixel, the main character is standing under a color shower to coat himself in yellow paint. Full of yellow paint, Pixel drives and paints tiles around him to complete a puzzle. Pixel uses a large sponge cube to remove paint where the tiles are colored wrongly.\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026310/extras/cb1e8a63d17a67e0bc62feae86e24d5f.webm?t=1769180281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026310/extras/cb1e8a63d17a67e0bc62feae86e24d5f.mp4?t=1769180281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> Solve physics based color puzzles that rely on your wit and agility. Enjoy unlimited hints,  optional challenges and no time limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World:</strong> Explore different environments inside and outside the Printer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community:</strong> Meet and befriend other robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisation:</strong> Dress up your Pixel and decorate your Printer home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026310/extras/8c14e6dacc258357d69db4ea460b06d1.poster.avif?t=1769180281\" aria-label=\"Pixel is happy and waiving arms under a blue color shower. Then Pixel is shown driving really fast around the puzzle map.\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026310/extras/8c14e6dacc258357d69db4ea460b06d1.webm?t=1769180281\" type=\"video/w